    "body": "Review fix for the review at 65987436, pushed as 415b2bd7 (also merges upstream/main, clean, no hand-resolved hunks).\n\n- **Blocker - pick hints said Ctrl where the picks read `mods.command`:** fixed. `geo_page.rs` `EDGE_HINT` is now `edge_hint()` (built with `chord(\"click\")`), the \"Click selects\" hover is `click_selects_hint()` (`command_key()`), and `boundary.rs` `HINTS` is now `hints()` with the picking line built from `command_key()`. macOS shows Cmd, other OSes Ctrl.\n- **Decision record `docs/decisions/1239-cmd-hints.md`:** corrected; it now says the picks read `mods.command` and the pick hints follow `command_key()`.\n- **Host-only tests (non-blocking):** done. Added pure `command_key_for(macos: bool)`; `command_key_for_names_both_platforms` checks Cmd and Ctrl on any host. New `pick_hints_name_the_command_key` pins the three hints.\n- **Changelog \"PR pending\" (non-blocking):** done, the body now reads PR #1293.\n- No structural assertion pinned the old wording (grep of crates/ui); no snapshot PNGs touched.\n\nGate (macOS, on 415b2bd7):\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: 620 passed, 0 failed, 5 ignored\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test feedback`: 6 passed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
