    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 415b2bd72727f5296b6a7605dca3cf1386368435 -->\n**Delta re-review (M3) of 65987436..415b2bd7: ready for the maintainer to merge. The blocker is fixed.**\n\n**The fix:**\n- The three pick hints now go through the helper:\n  - `geo_page.rs` `edge_hint()` (`chord(\"click\")`);\n  - `geo_page.rs` `click_selects_hint()` (`command_key()`);\n  - `boundary.rs` `hints()`.\n- They read Cmd on macOS and Ctrl elsewhere, matching the picks, which test `mods.command` (`edge_pick.rs:22`, `interact.rs:164,171`, `feature_click.rs:191`).\n- `docs/decisions/1239-cmd-hints.md` is corrected.\n- `command_key_for(macos)` is pure, and `pick_hints_name_the_command_key` pins the hints.\n\n**The merge of main:** 783f1cba has an empty remerge-diff. No snapshot PNGs, `build.rs`, `.github`, scripts, dependencies or process files changed.\n\n**Tests,** trial-merged with current main (clean):\n- `camcraft-ui` lib `--test-threads=1`: 620 passed.\n- `feedback` 6, `boundary` 3, `boundary_picks` 6, `edge_loop_pick` 3.\n- Clippy is clean.\n\n**Labels:** `needs-rework` is left for the maintainer to clear.\n",
